Colors:
- Background: #0D0D0D
- Surface: #161616
- Surface hover: #1C1C1C
- Border: #242424
- Brand blue: #4DA8FF
- Brand blue dim: #1A3A5C
- Text primary: #F0F0F0
- Text secondary: #ADADAD
- Text label: #999999
- Success: #3DDC84
- Warning: #F5A623
- Danger: #FF4D4D

Typography rules:
- Stat labels: uppercase, letter-spacing 0.08em, font size 11px, color #ADADAD
- Stat numbers: font size 28px, weight 700
- Section titles: font size 13px, weight 600, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.06em
- Body text: font size 14px, weight 400
- Card padding: 20px
- Border radius for cards: 16px
- Border radius for buttons: 10px
